      "description": {
        "es": "Sin descripción disponible.",
        "en": "This Pokémon has the combined effects of Unnerve and Grim Neigh.\n\nOpposing Pokémon cannot eat held Berries while this Pokémon is in battle. Affected Pokémon can still use Bug Bite or Pluck to eat a target's Berry.\n\nWhen this Pokémon knocks out a target, it utters a terrifying neigh, which boosts its Sp. Atk stat."
      }
